      "text": "Removal of diagonal **m9 (n3-n2)** eliminates a primary load path for the two vertical loads at n2/n4. The indeterminate truss redistributes force into the remaining very small members (0.11 in\u00b2).\n\nAfter the change (`lc_benchmark`):\n- **m2**: 6267 MPa tension, allowable 172.3 MPa \u2192 SF = 0.027\n- **m5**: 506 MPa tension \u2192 SF = 0.34\n- **m6**: 1137 MPa tension \u2192 SF = 0.15\n- **m7**: 228 MPa tension \u2192 SF = 0.76\n- **m10**: 8864 MPa compression \u2192 SF = 0.019\n\nAll exceed allowable stress (|stress| > 172.368925 MPa). Before the change all members were below allowable (max m5 at 156.7 MPa).\n\nDisplacements after change are >3 m at n1/n2, indicating near-mechanism behavior.\n\nThe change is unsafe and requires human review.",
